OL,3,GNEWSADismay as SEND school is delayed
OL,4,Auntil 2029
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong-awaited plans for a new autism
OL,7,Fschool in Worcestershire have been
OL,8,Fdelayed until 2029 - with parents
OL,9,Fcalling it "devastating".
OL,11,FThe government has told Worcestershire
OL,12,FCounty Council a 120-place special free
OL,13,Fschool in Malvern will not be ready to
OL,14,Fopen for another three years at the
OL,15,Fearliest.
OL,17,FUntil now it was scheduled to open in
OL,18,FSeptember 2027, but the department for
OL,19,Feducation has pushed it back after a
OL,20,Ffunding review.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
